# One move per signal: curation's, and the route that turns a signal into work.
# Written only through crew (crew signal move, crew unit add --signal), never
# by hand. See README.md.
#
#   recsel -t Move -e "Move = 'route'" signals/moves.rec
#   recfix --check signals/moves.rec

%rec: Move
%doc: A signal's one standing move: what it names, why, when and by whom.
%key: Signal
%mandatory: Signal Move Date By
%allowed: Signal Move Target Reason Date By
%type: Move enum attach challenge new-territory answered drop route
%type: Date date
